          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14075254/assets/9614ff63a66cf5428a4107828b08ba16c43e3e021f6620d408d8b70358a3e535.png)\nConsider the matrices shown above. \nGiven that $D=P^T \\! AP,$ where $P$ is an orthogonal matrix, which of the following could be the first column of the matrix $P?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14075254/assets/9acec021ce321e77ad541ecbb0a38944aa4991ec26c721e0e59a521490269d06.png)",
